  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.2-beta.3`\n\n### Features\n\n- implement tunnel traffic tracking and reset functionality ([b3834e8f](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/b3834e8f696bd5e8cc962a659eab37d988fb3792))\n- implement bandwidth limiting for SFTP transfers ([57620ad5](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/57620ad50b49a6e2dabae13204e503f8d9951bf7))\n- implement SFTP conflict resolution dialog and handling ([38a80a00](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/38a80a004fb190467a7ed10e0078242aca5ea740))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- refactor connection state management in terminal lifecycle for consistency ([9bac8fea](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9bac8feaa0bc9cc78a278261f544305d118a72d9))\n\n### Performance\n\n- enhance button styles and hover effects in broadcast and terminal components ([aecaf097](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/aecaf0979d283ffe050bf85bd4e45ff22b1a9284))\n- implement sudo password autofill feature ([23ee3255](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/23ee3255f3fa0360e962f4152153a76c1caee47f))\n\n### Other changes\n\n- enhance README and documentation for ZMODEM file transfer support ([38200d65](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/38200d65916712a00af5889e7524e2349ac6b32e))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.2-beta.3...v0.4.2-beta.4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.2-beta.3...v0.4.2-beta.4)\n",
